ate it doesn't append anything. Either way, I'm glad it got solved so easily.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140959827/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140983679","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109137#issuecomment-3140983679","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109137","id":3140983679,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67N5t_","user":{"login":"ketexon","id":29184562,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTg0NTYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29184562?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon","html_url":"https://github.com/ketexon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ketexon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T18:41:05Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T18:41:05Z","body":"Ah, I did find that this is actually on the docs for [external editor](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/editor/external_editor.html), but I think it should maybe also be linked/mentioned in the dedicated [VScode page](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/contributing/development/configuring_an_ide/visual_studio_c